       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "k27",
       "text": "what will it cost me to run?",
       "marks": [
        "strong"
       ]
      },
      {
       "_type": "span",
       "_key": "k28",
       "text": " Brochure figures don't help much, so we pulled twelve months of metered data from four homes we installed in and around Dunfermline.",
       "marks": []
      }
     ]
    },
